@X0DQ.   @X0FHow can I become a MetaWorlds Alpha or Beta Tester?

@X0D@X0EA.   @X0FThe Beta Test cycle will begin the first of October and will be open
     to all PCBoard Sysops that have pre-ordered the MetaWorlds software.
 
 
@X0DQ.   @X0FWill there be an OS/2 version of MetaWorlds?
 
@X0D@X0EA.   @X0FAn OS/2 version of the MetaWorlds Server was originally announced
     for release at the same time as the Windows version.  Unfortunately
     we have been forced to place our plans for the OS/2 version on hold
     until after the Windows version is shipping because of a lack of
     available technical information from IBM and certain development
     tools that we need from other software vendors.
 
 
@X0DQ.   @X0FPCBoard purchases include a year of free upgrades, which can be
     renewed on an annual bases after that.  Will you offer a similar
     program with MetaWorlds?

@X0D@X0EA.   @X0FMetaWorlds purchases will not include a year of free upgrades but
     will include minor upgrades or bug fixes.

     We are considering offering an annual subscription program but no
     decision has been made.


@X0DQ.   @X0FWill I be able to upgrade between MetaWorlds licences for the
     difference in price?
 
@X0D@X0EA.   @X0FYes.  With MetaWorlds we will support an Upsize option just like we
     did with PCBoard.  You just pay the difference in retail price between
     the package you have and the package you want.


